{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、小さい頃に『へそだしルック』のことを『へそだしリュック』だと思っていた若月です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リュックなのに、なぜへそが見えるし(笑)とか思ってました。うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて本日、北海道に上陸しました!若月、中田、橋本、生駒、大和です(σ*´∀｀)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪をほとんど見かけない静岡県民の若月にとっては未知の光景でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0287.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0211.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道っていいところだよね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうめいっぱい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみたいです(｀・ω・´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、若月はもう感動。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん・゜・(つД｀)・゜・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとぉ・゜・(つД｀)・゜・泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は今日嬉しいことがありましたああああ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0268.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは、『乃木坂って、どこ？』のタイトルコールが09位だったことです(  ；∀；)これは、真剣に高まったああああああぁって感じでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0267.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!みなさん 大好きすぎます!!!!って、本当に(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"09位なんてそんな光栄な(  ；∀；)本当にありがとうございました！しかし、若月は次回何かあればですが、もっと一言だけでも…この子いいなと思っていただけるように、頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0306.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のレベルアップへ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな 嬉しすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜中に高まった若月は明日の北海道イベント頑張れそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0205.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも寒い（つд；*)!この寒さにびっくりしましたよぉ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は寒さなんて吹き飛ばして頑張りたいと思います!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらして下さる方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0179.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はよろしくお願いいたします!室内ではありますが、何せ駅なので暖かい服装でお越しくださいね♪(/ω＼*)待ってるお!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またイベント終了したらまた記事書きますね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ、ばかつきぃ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0294.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/dimg0295.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(※初めましての方!!ばかつきというのは『バイバイ』と『わかつき』が一体化して、『ばかつき』になりました(笑))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道から写メじゃーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/111203_005821.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}